Inspect Nushell plumbing modules.

Usage:
  strap nu modules
  strap nu path plumbing
  strap nu source-line plumbing

The `plumbing` module contains Nu-first immutable state and context commands, including closure-based combinators such as `with-events`, `map-events`, `where-events`, and `with-extract`.

Example:
  source '/path/to/strap/nu/plumbing.nu'
  open state.json | with-events {|events| $events | where from == user }
